          "nonBranchLocationId": null,
          "branchLocationId": "RICHVALE",
          "featuredImageId": "6a255d3290cc4e3a790c3895",
          "bibIds": [],
          "description": "<p><strong>Ages: 9</strong><strong>–12</strong><strong>&nbsp;years</strong></p>\n<p>Spark your imagination in this hands-on workshop with author Karen Krossing. You'll write your own mystery story, create fantastical worlds and the characters who live in them, and develop stories about real people--including you! With fresh and inspiring story-starters, you'll have fun with words and develop your creative writing skills.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Cost: $40</strong><br></p>",
          "title": "WordPlay Story Writing Workshop (﻿9–12 yrs)",
          "end": "2026-08-12T17:30",
